            "\\subsection{Compare to other existing approaches}\n",
            "\\label{sec:ablation_compare}\n",
            "\n",
            "We conduct a set of additional studies and show that self-consistency significantly outperforms existing methods including sample-and-rank, beam search, and ensemble-based approaches.\n",
            "\n",
            "\\vspace{-0.1in}\n",
            "\\paragraph{Comparison to Sample-and-Rank}\n",
            "One commonly used approach to improve generation quality is sample-and-rank, where multiple sequences are sampled from the decoder and then ranked according to each sequence's log probability \\citep{adiwardana2020humanlike}.\n",
            "We compare self-consistency with sample-and-rank on GPT-3 \\textit{code-davinci-001}, by sampling the same number of sequences from the decoder as self-consistency and taking the final answer from the top-ranked sequence.\n",
            "The results are shown in Figure~\\ref{fig:gpt}.\n",
            "While sample-and-rank does improve the accuracy with additionally sampled sequences and ranking, the gain is much smaller compared to self-consistency.\n",
